  "notes": [
    "HTTP API plus server-sent events for WATCHOUT 7 (default port 3019). Timeline, cue and cue-group choices are filled from the connected show and are not enumerable offline.",
    "Source quirks: jump_to_time.time is a number field with the string default \"1000\"; send_inputs.input_value is a textinput that also carries min/max/step.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base 1.x: no expressions."
